ame where players are divided into two teams: humans and zombies.\nThe goal is simple: humans must survive until the end of the 6 waves, while zombies try to infect all the humans.\n\nAs a Human: 👤\nFind a safe spot, build barricades, cooperate, fight off zombies, and upgrade\n\nAs a Zombie: 🧟\nAttack humans, coordinate with other zombies, and don’t give up: Even if you die, you’ll respawn and keep attacking until all humans are infected or until the wave has ended.\n\n[PC Controls] 💻\nE - Grab prop\nRMB (Right mouse button) - Use zombie ability / Nail prop\nQ - Zombie type selection menu / Rotate prop\nT - Tilt prop\nB - Shop\nO - Cosmetic Shop\nI - Cosmetic Inventory\nF - Flashlight\nZ - Emotes\nCTRL - Crouch\n\n[Console Controls] 🎮\nX - Grab prop / Use zombie ability / Nail prop \nUp on DPad - Flashlight\nDown on DPad - Emotes\nL2 - Tilt Prop\nR2 - Rotate prop\n\nTags: Zombie Survival, Multiplayer, Half-Life, Valve, Garry's Mod, FPS, First Person Shooter","path":"/game/18856160616-undead-defense","slug":"18856160616-undead-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/68955dbc145df7af23693e86f37368e4a221d39fc08718d7f0c73531b17f693d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-92580b268c848d69ec7a0a2921fad893/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":59,"visitor":20391336,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-22T01:41:59.944Z","creator":{"name":"the crumble fan group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":554588260,"name":"Sonic Universe RP (v2.1.3) ","desc":"","path":"/game/554588260-sonic-universe-rp-v2-1-3","slug":"554588260-sonic-universe-rp-v2-1-3","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/15a7e0d39ae7862a738fde1e64c8efc7e5b4f37451c8d93ec9a442630495b7d2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aff987efa3d888a40bca2117aec7746c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":58,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":